<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"bullet\">Lisez le message ci-dessous. </br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<style>\ndiv.indent  {margin-left: 2em;}\n</style>\n\n<div class=indent>\n<br/>M. Dupont,  </br></br>Bienvenue \u00e0 CompCentral ! Nous sommes tr\u00e8s heureux de vous accueillir comme stagiaire dans notre service \u00e0 la client\u00e8le. </br></br>Votre superviseuse sera Laura Caron. On vous attend pour une r\u00e9union le 2 juin \u00e0 10 h. Mme Caron va vous informer sur vos responsabilit\u00e9s.</br></br>Les services de CompCentral sont ouverts au public du lundi au vendredi de 8 h 30 \u00e0 17 h.  Veuillez arriver \u00e0 8 h. Nous recevons beaucoup d'appels t\u00e9l\u00e9phoniques et de courriels avant le d\u00e9but de la journ\u00e9e de travail.  </br></br> Les employ\u00e9s prennent une pause d\u00e9jeuner de 12 h \u00e0 13 h chaque jour. Vous pouvez prendre votre d\u00e9jeuner dans votre bureau, ou bien aller au caf\u00e9.</br></br>Le code d'utilisateur de votre ordinateur est stagiaire34, et le code pour ouvrir la porte principale est le 3434.</br></br> Bien \u00e0 vous,</br>Joseph Bouchard.<br/><br/></div>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\n<span class=\"bullet\">\u00c9crivez vos notes dans les espaces ci-dessous.</span><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Lorsque vous avez \u00e9crit toutes vos notes, appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Allez \u00e0 l'exercice \u00e9crit</span>.</span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/> <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vos notes</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Vous avez fini !", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Avez-vous \u00e9crit vos notes?</span> </br>Il faut inclure :<ul><li>Les noms et les titres</li><li>Les dates</li><li>Les heures</li><li>Les informations nouvelles</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Appuyer sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Soumettre</span> pour sauvegarder vos notes.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "grading_chart", "grading_contents": {"body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "co